8AAAABY-ycew","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T17:05:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T17:06:17Z","body":"I'm trying to fix this right now, but, Line2D famously has no antialiasing and that's the main thing I'm struggling with. Also has no miterlimits.\n\nI'm doing miterlimits to solve this, but implementing it with bevels only, it sounds better to me as it's one consistent rule. Then again this is compat-breaking even outside of the behavior I reported as a bug, but those are also cases where the miters aren't that big unless you're encountering the bug.\n\nSo I don't know how to solve this. Bevels only, or a miterlimit?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971418235/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971773616","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124090#issuecomment-5971773616","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124090","id":5971773616,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABY_IIsA","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T17:42:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T17:47:55Z","body":"> Also has no miterlimits.\n\nReally? 🤔 I thought LineBuilder did precisely that, when an angle becomes too sharp it turns into a bevel. And if enabled it can even use a rounded corner to not even have the sharpness issue in the first place.\nI dunno about antialiasing tho. It's just too bad both codes evolved separately without re-use. I the idea of `draw_polyline` has been to have a simplified version but then more limited.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971773616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971789335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124090#issuecomment-5971789335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124090","id":5971789335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABY_JGFw","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T17:44:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T00:40:34Z","body":"Oh my bad! It does have miterlimit, I don't know why I misremembered it, it's the sharp_limit property (and also having miters without miterlimit would be quite funny). But indeed, no antialiasing https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115291\n\nI'm changing draw_polyline() to have bevels by default instead, so if I manage to finish it, the PR will have that.\n\nEdit: Sorry, I've given up","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971789335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]